[00:12.88](Psalm 29:11)
[00:12.88]1. Like an island of calm
[00:16.50]In dark stormy seas,
[00:19.28]God’s people are living in peace.
[00:25.74]With our eyes of faith,
[00:28.80]We see beyond the clouds
[00:32.06]And know that the storm
[00:34.86]soon will cease.
[00:37.92](Chorus)
[00:38.08]To the ends of the earth,
[00:41.68]There’ll be peace at last
[00:44.62]For all eternity.
[00:51.34]From the valleys below
[00:53.96]To the mountaintops,
[00:57.98]All creation will see
[01:02.78]Peace at last.
[01:12.03]2. When the new world is here,
[01:16.47]All will be one
[01:18.52]On earth and in heaven above.
[01:24.91]And the peace we’ll know
[01:28.01]We’ve never known before—
[01:31.21]A world ruled by justice and love.
[01:37.15](Chorus)
[01:37.15]To the ends of the earth,
[01:40.83]There’ll be peace at last
[01:43.77]For all eternity.
[01:49.93]From the valleys below
[01:53.13]To the mountaintops,
[01:58.17]All creation will see
[02:02.53]Peace at last.
[02:21.45](Chorus)
[02:22.49]To the ends of the earth,
[02:25.67]There’ll be peace at last
[02:28.97]For all eternity.
[02:35.33]From the valleys below
[02:38.17]To the mountaintops,
[02:43.29]All creation will see.
[02:48.15](Chorus)
[02:48.15]To the ends of the earth,
[02:51.11]There’ll be peace at last
[02:54.39]For all eternity.
[03:00.99]From the valleys below
[03:03.53]To the mountaintops,
[03:07.59]All creation will see
[03:12.87]Peace at last,
[03:18.73]Peace at last!
